--- task-router.js ---
@sig c2a05f85
class TaskRouter|4m|routes agent-pool task events into persisted chat state and WS deltas
  .route()|cache task events, update StateGraph, broadcast chat meta/done/error
  .replayCachedNotifications()|replays buffered events before delayed terminal notifications
  ._findChatForTask()|finds chat owning a pending task id from StateGraph
  ._persistFinalTaskResult()|normalizes final result text/tool/meta into chat messages
  CALLS→console.log,getStateGraph,Date.now,sg.del,console.warn,createWatchdog,sg.commit,console.error
createWatchdog(onTimeout:() => void,inactivityMs:number=)→clearTimeout,setTimeout,watchdog.kick|small inactivity timer with kick/reset API
PATTERNS: event-sourced task cache|server-side chat message normalization|light WS deltas
EDGE_CASES: no subscribers cache 5s|terminal events delayed after streams|lost result fetch clears task
